WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.043 --> 00:00:03.148
♪♪

00:00:04.094 --> 00:00:06.266
TOM HIDDLESTON
Uh... Hi?

00:00:06.266 --> 00:00:09.857
Hi, hello, it's me. Um, it's Tom.

00:00:09.857 --> 00:00:11.849
Look, um, I'm sorry to interrupt...

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:18.045
It's just, I, um, I've noticed that
in these long superhero montages,

00:00:18.045 --> 00:00:21.990
Loki tends to get,
you know, a bit left out.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:26.019
Even though, arguably,
he's incredibly heroic, himself.

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:28.957
You know, cunning... Charming...

00:00:28.957 --> 00:00:34.369
I could go on, but maybe,
why don't I just prove it to you?

00:00:34.394 --> 00:00:37.472
Wednesdays are the new Fridays.

00:00:37.472 --> 00:00:41.358
♪♪

